      "body": "`PyMutex_Lock(&tables_lock)` cannot be used \"free\" allocator hooks which don't acquire the GIL.\r\n\r\nMaybe `PyMutex_Lock(&tables_lock)` should be preferred in functions which hold the GIL?",
